# Frame runs fine WITHOUT any keys — AI uses sample responses and your data
# stays in the browser (localStorage) until you connect a database.
#
# To go live:
#   1. Copy this file to ".env.local"
#   2. Fill in the values below
#   3. Restart the dev server
#
# (.env.local is git-ignored, so your real keys never get committed.)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI — your Anthropic key powers live AI for everyone using the app.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com  (leave blank for sample responses)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Database + login (Supabase). Create a free project at https://supabase.com,
# then go to Project Settings → API and copy the two values below.
# These NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are meant to be public — Row Level Security
# (supabase/schema.sql) is what actually protects each user's data.
# See docs/DATABASE.md for the full walkthrough.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Payments (Stripe) — added later when we turn on real checkout. Leave blank.
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
